        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "碗: measure compatible referents",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "碗 can count a bowlful of food or drink. It names the container measure, not necessarily ownership of a bowl.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我吃一碗饭。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ chī yī wǎn fàn 。",
                "meaning": "I eat one bowl of rice.",
                "audio": "9d0fe0a45bf77cc9f8ef222786e0f66bdc0d00dab930d958f831a5b73b99e1f2"
              },
              {
                "text": "他吃两碗饭。",
                "pinyin": "tā chī liǎng wǎn fàn 。",
                "meaning": "He eats two bowls of rice.",
                "audio": "92879f569119ad180110dd407dae7bb08be5e293a799968572a033a49e970f9f"
